{"id":"f8b230bf5d6a0f44","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-realmul.md","title":"Multiplication on Reals","display":"df-realmul — Multiplication on Reals","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-realmul","aliases":["58-df-realmul"],"display":"df-realmul — Multiplication on Reals","depends_on":["[[58-df-dedekind-cut]]","[[58-df-reals]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-realmul"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-realmul</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-realmul — Multiplication on Reals"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"37d8cf418a7b6598\" href=\"?note=37d8cf418a7b6598\" title=\"58-df-dedekind-cut\">58-df-dedekind-cut</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"58-df-reals\">58-df-reals</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PositiveCutProduct}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{PositiveCutProduct}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealMul}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{RealMul}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in \\mathbb{R}\">\\(x \\in \\mathbb{R}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"58-df-reals\">58-df-reals</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y \\in \\mathbb{R}\">\\(y \\in \\mathbb{R}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"58-df-reals\">58-df-reals</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (positive real cuts)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in V\">\\(z\\in V\\)</span> (candidate product cut)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PositiveCutProduct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PositiveCutProduct}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealMul}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RealMul}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}cut\\text{-}multiplication}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PositiveCutProduct}_S(z,x,y)\\leftrightarrow\nx,y\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land\nz=\\{r\\in\\mathbb Q:r\\leq0\\lor\\exists p\\in x\\;\\exists q\\in y\\;(0&lt;p\\land0&lt;q\\land r&lt;pq)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}cut\\text{-}multiplication}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PositiveCutProduct}_S(z,x,y)\\leftrightarrow\nx,y\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land\nz=\\{r\\in\\mathbb Q:r\\leq0\\lor\\exists p\\in x\\;\\exists q\\in y\\;(0&lt;p\\land0&lt;q\\land r&lt;pq)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}realmul}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RealMul}_S(z,x,y)\\leftrightarrow x,y\\in\\mathbb R\\land\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(x=0\\lor y=0)\\land z=0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\lor x\\neq0\\land y\\neq0\\land\\exists u\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PositiveCutProduct}_S(u,|x|,|y|)\\land\n(((x&gt;0\\land y&gt;0)\\lor(x&lt;0\\land y&lt;0))\\to z=u)\\land\n(((x&gt;0\\land y&lt;0)\\lor(x&lt;0\\land y&gt;0))\\to z=-u)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}realmul}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RealMul}_S(z,x,y)\\leftrightarrow x,y\\in\\mathbb R\\land\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(x=0\\lor y=0)\\land z=0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\lor x\\neq0\\land y\\neq0\\land\\exists u\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PositiveCutProduct}_S(u,|x|,|y|)\\land\n(((x&gt;0\\land y&gt;0)\\lor(x&lt;0\\land y&lt;0))\\to z=u)\\land\n(((x&gt;0\\land y&lt;0)\\lor(x&lt;0\\land y&gt;0))\\to z=-u)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-dedekind-cut","status":"resolved","id":"37d8cf418a7b6598","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-dedekind-cut]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-reals","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-reals]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-reals","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x \\in \\mathbb{R}$ (see [[58-df-reals]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-reals","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$y \\in \\mathbb{R}$ (see [[58-df-reals]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PositiveCutProduct}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealMul}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"x \\in \\mathbb{R}","display":false},{"tex":"y \\in \\mathbb{R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PositiveCutProduct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealMul}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}cut\\text{-}multiplication}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PositiveCutProduct}_S(z,x,y)\\left